# Telescopic cascode OTA (one stage), single-ended.
# NMOS input pair M1a/M1b, NMOS cascodes M2a/M2b, PMOS high-swing cascode mirror load
# (top devices M3a/M3b gated by the diode-side cascode drain c1, cascodes M4a/M4b gated by vbp).
# VINN drives the output-side half (inverting); VINP the diode side.
# Bias (all from the one IREF): Rb lifts the NMOS cascode gate (= IREF net) to
# Vgs(M6) + IREF*Rb above the tail mirror gate n1; M7 copies the reference into the
# PMOS diode M8 and Rp drops vbp below its gate pa.
NMOS M1a d1 VINP tail
NMOS M1b d2 VINN tail
NMOS M2a c1 IREF d1
NMOS M2b VOUT IREF d2
PMOS M4a c1 vbp p1
PMOS M4b VOUT vbp p2
PMOS M3a p1 c1 VDD
PMOS M3b p2 c1 VDD
NMOS M5 tail n1 VSS
NMOS M6 n1 n1 VSS
R Rb IREF n1
NMOS M7 vbp n1 VSS
R Rp pa vbp
PMOS M8 pa pa VDD
